        <Param val="Part #1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Today you will complete a 3-part task two times. The first time will serve as a practice to get you used to the task, and the second time will serve as the real test in which you can earn money based on how well you perform.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this first part, you will learn word matches.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;First, you will see a target word at the top of the screen, with two possible matches &amp;#10;below it. Your job is to guess which word matches the top word. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will then get feedback about the accuracy of your choice and will try to remember the correct word match based on that feedback. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In the last round, you will earn points for each word you remember correctly.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For example: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABSTRACT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1) DOG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2) PLATE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To guess Option 1 – press the '1' key.&amp;#10;To guess Option 2 – press the '2' key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
