        <Param val="Please Try Again&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You got less than 3 correct responses during the practice round. In order to advance to the main task, you need to get at least 3 correct responses during the practice round. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Remember, to pick response a) press the ‘1’ key. To pick response b) press the ‘2’ key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press ‘t’ to restart the practice round.&amp;#10;" valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
